{"strongs": "H4264", "word": "מַחֲנֶה", "translit": "ma.cha.neh", "root": "חמת", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "encampment, camp", "definition": "מַחֲנֶה 214 noun masculine Gen 33:8 + 16 t. and feminine Ps 27:3 ; 1Chr 11:15 (on Gen 32:9 a see Di ) encampment, camp — absolute ׳ מ Gen 32:9 (twice in verse) + 126 t. (including Ezek 1:24 , strike out Co ); construct מַחֲנֵה Gen 32:3 + 56 t.; suffix מַחֲנֵהוּ Num 1:52 + 5 t.; מַחֲנֶיךָ Deut 23:15 ; Deut 29:10 , מַחֲנֶךָ Deut 23:15 , מַחֲנֵיכֶם Amos 4:10 , מַהֲנֵיהֶם Num 5:3 ; Judg 8:10 (compare below, and on form of noun with suffix see Ges «GKC:93»§ 93 . 3, R 3); plural absolute מִחֲנות Gen 32:8 + 9 t.; construct 1Chr 9:18 + 2 t., מַחֲנִים Num 13:19 suffix (apparetnly plural noun) מַחֲנֵיהֶם Josh 10:4 + 5 t.; — on dual see ׳ מ proper name below 1. camp, place of encampment: \\ \\ a. of caravan of travelers Gen 32:22 ( J ), especially of Israel at Exodus and in wilderness Exod 16:13 (twice in verse); Exod 19:16 ; Exod 19:17 (all P ; distinguished from עַם ); ׳ שַׁעַר מ Exod 32:26 ( J E ); especially ׳ מִחוּץ המ in connection with uncleanness, etc., Exod 29:14 ; Lev 4:12 ( P ) + often, of position of tent of meeting Exod 33:7 (twice in verse) ( J E ), contr. Num 2:17 ( P ), where of encampments of several tribes, compare Num 1:52 ; Num 2:3 ; Num 10:2 ; Num 10:5 ; Num 10:6 ; Num 10:25 etc., (all P ), already passing over to 3 (compare הַחֹנִים Num 10:5 ; Num 10:6 ); specifically of camp of Levites , surrounding tabernacle, so that P can say אֹהֶלמֿוֺעֵד מַחֲנֵה הַלְוִיִם Num 2:17 and so (late) of temple הַשֹּׁעֲרִים לְמַחֲנוֺת בְּנֵי לֵוִי 1Chr 9:18 , as well as ׳ שַׁעֲרֵי מַחֲנוֺת י 2Chr 31:2 plural (opposed to מִבְצָרִים = fortresses ) Num 13:19 . 2. camp of armed host Josh 6:11 (twice in verse); Josh 6:14 ( J E ), 1Sam 4:3 ; 1Sam 4:5 ; 1Sam 4:6 (twice in verse); 1Sam 4:7 ; 1Sam 17:53 ; 2Kgs 7:16 etc. 3. a. those who encamp Num 10:5 ; Num 10:6 ; 1Chr 11:15 ; Ps 27:3 (all with verb חנה ) compare (probably) Isa 37:36 = 2Kgs 19:35 , etc. \\ \\ b. company, body of people ; people and beasts Gen 32:8; Gen 32:9 (twice in verse); Gen 32:11 ; Gen 33:8 , funeral company of Jacob Gen 50:9 of Israel on march Exod 14:19 ; Exod 14:20 compare Num 10:5 ; Num 10:6 . \\ \\ c. army, host Josh 8:13 ; Josh 10:5 ; Josh 11:4 ; Judg 4:15 ; Judg 4:16 (twice in verse); Judg 7:1 ; Judg 7:8 ; Judg 8:10 (twice in verse); Judg 8:11 (twice in verse); Judg 8:12 ; 1Sam 17:1 ; 1Sam 17:46 ; 2Kgs 3:9 even while in the thick of the fight; 1Kgs 22:34 = 2Chr 18:33 etc.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2917')\">BDB2917</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4264')\">H4264</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2916')\">BDB2916</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2918')\">BDB2918</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מַחֲנֶה</bdbheb><sub>214</sub> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Gen 33:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,33,8)\">Gen 33:8</ref></sup> + 16 t. and <b>feminine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Ps 27:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,27,3)\">Ps 27:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 11:15\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(13,11,15)\">1Chr 11:15</ref></sup> (on <ref ref=\"Gen 32:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,9)\">Gen 32:9</ref> a see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>) <highlightword>encampment, camp</highlightword> — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 32:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,9)\">Gen 32:9</ref> (twice in verse) + 126 t. (including <ref ref=\"Ezek 1:24\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(26,1,24)\">Ezek 1:24</ref>, strike out <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup>); construct <bdbheb>מַחֲנֵה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 32:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,3)\">Gen 32:3</ref> + 56 t.; suffix <bdbheb>מַחֲנֵהוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 1:52\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"52\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"52\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,52)\">Num 1:52</ref> + 5 t.; <bdbheb>מַחֲנֶיךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 23:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,23,15)\">Deut 23:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 29:10\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(5,29,10)\">Deut 29:10</ref>, <bdbheb>מַחֲנֶךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 23:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,23,15)\">Deut 23:15</ref>, <bdbheb>מַחֲנֵיכֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 4:10\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(30,4,10)\">Amos 4:10</ref>, <bdbheb>מַהֲנֵיהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 5:3\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,3)\">Num 5:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 8:10\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,10)\">Judg 8:10</ref> (compare below, and on form of noun with suffix see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:93»§ 93</sup>. 3, R 3); plural absolute <bdbheb>מִחֲנות</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 32:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,8)\">Gen 32:8</ref> + 9 t.; construct <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:18\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,18)\">1Chr 9:18</ref> + 2 t., <bdbheb>מַחֲנִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 13:19\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(4,13,19)\">Num 13:19</ref> suffix (apparetnly plural noun) <bdbheb>מַחֲנֵיהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 10:4\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(6,10,4)\">Josh 10:4</ref> + 5 t.; — on dual see <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <b>proper name</b> below <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>camp, place of encampment:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> of caravan of travelers <ref ref=\"Gen 32:22\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,22)\">Gen 32:22</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), especially of Israel at Exodus and in wilderness <ref ref=\"Exod 16:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,16,13)\">Exod 16:13</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Exod 19:16\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(2,19,16)\">Exod 19:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 19:17\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(2,19,17)\">Exod 19:17</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>; distinguished from <bdbheb>עַם</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שַׁעַר מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 32:26\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(2,32,26)\">Exod 32:26</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); especially <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִחוּץ המ</bdbheb> in connection with uncleanness, etc., <ref ref=\"Exod 29:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,14)\">Exod 29:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 4:12\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(3,4,12)\">Lev 4:12</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) + often, of position of tent of meeting <ref ref=\"Exod 33:7\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(2,33,7)\">Exod 33:7</ref> (twice in verse) (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), contr. <ref ref=\"Num 2:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,2,17)\">Num 2:17</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), where of encampments of several tribes, compare <ref ref=\"Num 1:52\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"52\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"52\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,52)\">Num 1:52</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 2:3\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(4,2,3)\">Num 2:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 10:2\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,2)\">Num 10:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 10:5\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,5)\">Num 10:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 10:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,6)\">Num 10:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 10:25\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,25)\">Num 10:25</ref> etc., (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), already passing over to <b>3</b> (compare <bdbheb>הַחֹנִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 10:5\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,5)\">Num 10:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 10:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,6)\">Num 10:6</ref>); specifically of <highlight>camp of Levites</highlight>, surrounding tabernacle, so that <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup> can say <bdbheb>אֹהֶלמֿוֺעֵד מַחֲנֵה הַלְוִיִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 2:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,2,17)\">Num 2:17</ref> and so (late) of temple <bdbheb>הַשֹּׁעֲרִים לְמַחֲנוֺת בְּנֵי לֵוִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:18\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,18)\">1Chr 9:18</ref>, as well as <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שַׁעֲרֵי מַחֲנוֺת י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:2\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,2)\">2Chr 31:2</ref> plural (opposed to <bdbheb>מִבְצָרִים</bdbheb> = <highlight>fortresses</highlight>) <ref ref=\"Num 13:19\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(4,13,19)\">Num 13:19</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>camp of armed host</highlight> <ref ref=\"Josh 6:11\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(6,6,11)\">Josh 6:11</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Josh 6:14\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(6,6,14)\">Josh 6:14</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"1Sam 4:3\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,3)\">1Sam 4:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 4:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,5)\">1Sam 4:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 4:6\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,6)\">1Sam 4:6</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"1Sam 4:7\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,7)\">1Sam 4:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 17:53\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"53\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"53\" onclick=\"bcv(9,17,53)\">1Sam 17:53</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 7:16\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(12,7,16)\">2Kgs 7:16</ref> etc. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3. a.</b> <highlight>those who encamp</highlight> <ref ref=\"Num 10:5\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,5)\">Num 10:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 10:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,6)\">Num 10:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 11:15\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(13,11,15)\">1Chr 11:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 27:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,27,3)\">Ps 27:3</ref> (all with verb <bdbheb>חנה</bdbheb>) compare (probably) <ref ref=\"Isa 37:36\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(23,37,36)\">Isa 37:36</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Kgs 19:35\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(12,19,35)\">2Kgs 19:35</ref>, etc. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <highlight>company, body of people</highlight>; people and beasts Gen 32:8; <ref ref=\"Gen 32:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,9)\">Gen 32:9</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Gen 32:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,11)\">Gen 32:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 33:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,33,8)\">Gen 33:8</ref>, funeral company of Jacob <ref ref=\"Gen 50:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,50,9)\">Gen 50:9</ref> of Israel on march <ref ref=\"Exod 14:19\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(2,14,19)\">Exod 14:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 14:20\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(2,14,20)\">Exod 14:20</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Num 10:5\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,5)\">Num 10:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 10:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,10,6)\">Num 10:6</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <highlight>army, host</highlight> <ref ref=\"Josh 8:13\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(6,8,13)\">Josh 8:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 10:5\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(6,10,5)\">Josh 10:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 11:4\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(6,11,4)\">Josh 11:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 4:15\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,15)\">Judg 4:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 4:16\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,16)\">Ju